<26>款已省略\n\n  <27> 《教育框架法》部分修订如下。\n\n  第 17-2 条第 4 款中的“教育、科学和技术部长”应改为“教育部长”。\n\n  <28> 至 <710> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00078","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000901-285783-ko","scope":"BODY","start":9310,"end":9318,"target_id":"f7a8025bb27c32a2b0adcc61c417b398d3f2ff2c45c1d171020aaef228a969d1","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00079","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000901-285783-ko","scope":"BODY","start":9318,"end":9362,"target_id":"a7e1af9d9d06c2f9f50a676e4d6663d343be979dbbb29e85960778a96ffe2e20","source_hash":"294382f59f96d8ded206345ebd7e51f6434d176575e6020cc72db46ccf8a6bd5","text":"补充规定 <第13003号，2015年1月20日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00080","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000901-285783-ko","scope":"BODY","start":9362,"end":9416,"target_id":"8e36d80f507df0025e57336e26c328cda3584ae06d6a0734df1d6c3553b1c733","source_hash":"9c7513a88d4c82f1e79cb4d42754de138bee8bc84c321033be34265dab418065","text":"补充规定 <第14150号，2016年5月29日>\n\n本法自公布之日起三个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00081","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000901-285783-ko","scope":"BODY","start":9416,"end":9470,"target_id":"868ca0f894703e7db146c140bf08fa70b16ab05b322cb178e84b0cb08586a91b","source_hash":"0aed97b4d4d634e21a8762f3a19d63d5df624ecd3ea4a72272e60d5b8f38ccaa","text":"补充规定 <第14601号，2017年3月21日>\n\n本法自公布之日起三个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00082","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000901-285783-ko","scope":"BODY","start":9470,"end":9525,"target_id":"392c8e3f6881fb19013890029c2ac737cb23f8047080e7160472b0c62a71d198","source_hash":"8da317e8a8479640e586557adf825e21ca52226483a77540d0cd91d46085e1f3","text":"补充规定 <第15950号，2018年12月18日>\n\n本法自公布之日起六个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00083","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000901-285783-ko","scope":"BODY","start":9525,"end":9618,"target_id":"3edfb48a4afbc55f9fe74cb102cee46ddff93ddc661a50551b543caa2b958bb4","source_hash":"0cd2350801145646d5c30dd66d576155f88d23e2913fd9605cd78749962c178a","text":"补充规定（关于对法律术语重组教育委员会管辖范围内的34项法律进行部分修正的法案）<法案编号17954，2021年3月23日>\n\n本法